## 1. System Topology & Infrastructure
This project utilizes a high-performance **Hybrid Infrastructure Topology** to ensure 99.9% uptime and sub-second global response times.

*   **Edge-Native Frontend (Vercel):** The storefront is deployed on **Vercel’s Global Edge Network**, ensuring a **Time to First Byte (TTFB)** of <50ms.
*   **Decoupled Backend (Hostinger):** A headless **Hostinger Infrastructure** serves the WooCommerce API, isolated from public traffic for maximum security.
*   **The Technical Handshake:** Custom-engineered **Asynchronous REST API Bridge** synchronizes live datasets between environments.

---

## 2. Core Web Vital & LCP Engineering
To achieve elite status, the platform has been optimized for Google's **Core Web Vitals**, focusing on the mobile experience.

*   **LCP Optimization (Largest Contentful Paint):** Implemented **Priority Resource Preloading** and `fetchpriority="high"` for hero assets. This tells the browser to prioritize the most important visual element immediately.
*   **Zero Layout Shift (CLS):** Every component is engineered with fixed aspect-ratio containers, ensuring a **CLS score of 0**.
*   **Bundle Engineering:** Maintained a sub-200kB footprint using **Route-Based Code Splitting**.

---

## 3. Accessibility & WCAG 2.1 Compliance
The site has been audited and updated to meet **WCAG 2.1 AA standards**, ensuring it is usable by everyone.

*   **Accessible Naming:** All interactive elements (buttons, links, cart triggers) feature descriptive **ARIA Labels**, ensuring compatibility with screen readers.
*   **Contrast Optimization:** Every text element has been tuned for a high **Contrast Ratio**, satisfying accessibility requirements for readability.
*   **Heading Hierarchy:** Programmatic enforcement of **Sequential Heading Structures (H1-H6)** for optimal SEO and navigational flow.

---

## 4. 100% Custom Engineering (Zero-Theme Policy)
*   **No Generic Themes:** Every UI component is a custom-coded React `.tsx` module. Zero dependency on bloated WordPress themes.
*   **Design System:** Built using custom **HSL Tokens** and a **Framer Motion Animation Engine**.

